<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_a9f69caa-cb18-fb43-4066-54d99e0d58ed" id="_a9f69caa-cb18-fb43-4066-54d99e0d58ed"></a>A special thank you to our CloudSigma, CloudFerro and Amazon for making cloud resources available to the Hackathon!</p>
