<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_dc211fa6-1930-2672-0b14-1fc6118c39a0" id="_dc211fa6-1930-2672-0b14-1fc6118c39a0"></a>The following JSON document is an example data structure that contains the necessary information for rendering the above template and generate an Application Package document.</p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_98c45850-92ad-ed63-9394-ec6a408ec878" id="_98c45850-92ad-ed63-9394-ec6a408ec878"></a><i>Example Application Properties</i></p>

