> <span class="mf">69.4641202526612034</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">)</span> <span class="n">orbitdirection</span><span class="ss">:DESCENDING</span> <span class="n">platformname</span><span class="ss">:Sentinel</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="mi">1</span> <span class="n">polarisationmode</span><span class="ss">:HH</span> <span class="no">HV</span> <span class="n">producttype</span><span class="ss">:SLC</span><span class="err">'</span></p>

